#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:6
msgid "# PostgreSQL Setup and Operations"
msgstr "# PostgreSQL 安装与运维"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:10
msgid ""
"> FreeAnima uses PostgreSQL for conversation archives, semantic memory, self "
"layer, and related data.  > Related concepts: [`memory.md`](../concepts/"
"memory.md), [`sleep.md`](../concepts/sleep.md).  > Security and credentials: "
"[`security.md`](security.md)."
msgstr ""
"> FreeAnima 使用 PostgreSQL 存储对话存档、语义记忆、自我层及相关数据。 > 相关"
"概念：[`memory.md`](../concepts/memory.md)、[`sleep.md`](../concepts/"
"sleep.md)。 > 安全与凭证：[`security.md`](security.md)。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:12
msgid "## Connection Configuration"
msgstr "## 连接配置"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:14
msgid "Set the database URL in `config.yaml`:"
msgstr "在 `config.yaml` 中设置数据库 URL："

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:21
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "```yaml\n"
#| "database:\n"
#| "  url: postgresql://user:pass@localhost:5432/anima\n"
#| "  # or pass:services/postgres/anima\n"
#| "```\n"
msgid ""
"```yaml\n"
"database:\n"
"  url: postgresql://user:pass@localhost:5432/anima\n"
"  # or inject from pass:\n"
"  # url: pass:services/postgres/anima\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"```yaml\n"
"database:\n"
"  url: postgresql://user:pass@localhost:5432/anima\n"
"  # 或 pass:services/postgres/anima\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:23
msgid ""
"Production **must** set `database.url`. Prefer pass for passwords instead of "
"plaintext in config. Path conventions: [`security.md`]"
"(security.md#credential-responsibilities)."
msgstr ""
"生产环境**必须**设置 `database.url`。密码优先使用 pass，避免在配置中明文存"
"放。路径约定见 [`security.md`](security.md#credential-responsibilities)。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:25
msgid "## Local Install (Debian)"
msgstr "## 本地安装（Debian）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:29
msgid ""
"```bash # Install PostgreSQL, create anima db/user (requires sudo)  sudo ./"
"scripts/setup-postgres-debian.sh"
msgstr ""
"```bash\n"
"# 安装 PostgreSQL，创建 anima 数据库/用户（需要 sudo）\n"
"sudo ./scripts/setup-postgres-debian.sh"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:32
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "# Write credentials to pass (script prints anima credential add … "
#| "command)  anima credential add services/postgres/anima url=… host=… "
#| "password=… database=anima"
msgid ""
"# Write credentials to pass (script prints anima credential add …)  anima "
"credential add services/postgres/anima url=… host=… password=… database=anima"
msgstr ""
"# 凭证写入 pass（脚本会打印 anima credential add … 命令） anima credential "
"add services/postgres/anima url=… host=… password=… database=anima"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:36
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "# database:\n"
#| "#   url: pass:services/postgres/anima\n"
#| "```\n"
msgid ""
"# config.yaml:\n"
"#   url: pass:services/postgres/anima\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"# database:\n"
"#   url: pass:services/postgres/anima\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:38
msgid ""
"Defaults: PostgreSQL 17, `localhost` only, `scram-sha-256`, dedicated "
"`anima` database and user."
msgstr ""
"默认：PostgreSQL 17、仅 `localhost`、`scram-sha-256`、专用 `anima` 数据库与用"
"户。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:40
msgid "## Extensions (One-Time)"
msgstr "## 扩展（一次性）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:42
msgid ""
"Full-text and vector search require PostgreSQL extensions. The app user "
"usually cannot `CREATE EXTENSION`; run as superuser:"
msgstr ""
"全文与向量检索需要 PostgreSQL 扩展。应用用户通常无法 `CREATE EXTENSION`；请以"
"超级用户执行："

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:47
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "```bash\n"
#| "sudo apt install postgresql-17-pgvector   # version matches psql --version\n"
#| "sudo -u postgres psql -d anima -f engine/db/scripts/ensure-pg-extensions.sql\n"
#| "```\n"
msgid ""
"```bash\n"
"sudo apt install postgresql-17-pgvector   # match psql --version\n"
"sudo -u postgres psql -d anima -f core/scripts/ensure-pg-extensions.sql\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"```bash\n"
"sudo apt install postgresql-17-pgvector   # 版本号与 psql --version 一致\n"
"sudo -u postgres psql -d anima -f engine/db/scripts/ensure-pg-extensions.sql\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:49
msgid ""
"Fresh Debian installs via `setup-postgres-debian.sh` handle extensions "
"automatically."
msgstr "通过 `setup-postgres-debian.sh` 全新安装的 Debian 会自动处理扩展。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:51
msgid "## Schema Migrations"
msgstr "## Schema 迁移"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/database.md:54
msgid ""
"**Production (recommended):** When PostgreSQL is configured, `anima service` "
"**auto-applies** pending schema migrations on startup."
msgstr ""
"**生产环境（推荐）：** 配置 PostgreSQL 后，`anima service` 启动时会**自动应用"
"**待执行的 schema 迁移。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/database.md:54
msgid "**Manual:**"
msgstr "**手动：**"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:59
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "# Schema\n"
#| "DATABASE_URL=\"$(anima credential get services/postgres/anima url)\" \\\n"
#| "  bun run --filter @freeanima/engine-db db:migrate\n"
msgid ""
"```bash\n"
"DATABASE_URL=\"$(anima credential get services/postgres/anima url)\" \\\n"
"  bun run --filter @freeanima/core/db db:migrate\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"# Schema\n"
"DATABASE_URL=\"$(anima credential get services/postgres/anima url)\" \\\n"
"  bun run --filter @freeanima/engine-db db:migrate\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:61
msgid "Run after extensions are installed, or restart `anima service`."
msgstr "安装扩展后执行，或重启 `anima service`。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:63
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "### Basic Rules"
msgid "## Backups"
msgstr "### 基础规则"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/database.md:67
msgid ""
"**Migrations do not replace backups** — schedule regular full backups (e.g. "
"`pg_dump`)."
msgstr "**迁移不能替代备份** — 请定期安排全量备份（如 `pg_dump`）。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/database.md:67
msgid "Back up before destructive changes."
msgstr "破坏性变更前先备份。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/database.md:67
msgid ""
"Include `~/.anima/` (`FREEANIMA_HOME` overridable) in backup policy — see "
"[`security.md`](security.md#data-persistence)."
msgstr ""
"备份策略应包含 `~/.anima/`（可用 `FREEANIMA_HOME` 覆盖）——见 [`security.md`]"
"(security.md#data-persistence)。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:69
msgid "## Integration Tests (Developers)"
msgstr "## 集成测试（开发者）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:71
msgid ""
"Full integration tests require **Docker** for a temporary PostgreSQL "
"instance:"
msgstr "完整集成测试需要 **Docker** 提供临时 PostgreSQL 实例："

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:76
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "```bash\n"
#| "bun run test:integration\n"
#| "bun run test              # unit + integration + E2E parallel\n"
#| "```\n"
msgid ""
"```bash\n"
"bun run test:integration\n"
"bun run test              # unit + integration in parallel\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"```bash\n"
"bun run test:integration\n"
"bun run test              # 单元 + 集成 + E2E 并行\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:78
msgid "pre-commit `test:changed` does **not** run integration tests."
msgstr "pre-commit 的 `test:changed` **不会**运行集成测试。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:80
msgid "## Troubleshooting"
msgstr "## 故障排查"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:86
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "| `memory_type` | Storage | Notes |\n"
#| "| ------------- | ------- | ----- |\n"
#| "| `semantic` | `semantic_memory` hybrid retrieval | Returns full `content` |\n"
#| "| `session` | `messages` hybrid retrieval | Returns matching `snippet`; optional `session` scopes message range |\n"
#| "| `limbic` | `limbic_memory` ILIKE | Limbic memory body |\n"
#| "| `autobiographical` | `autobiographical_memory` | `title` + `content` snippet |\n"
msgid ""
"| Symptom                     | Check                                                          |\n"
"| --------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Service fails on DB connect | `database.url`; PostgreSQL running; pass credentials readable  |\n"
"| Migration fails             | Extensions installed; DB user has DDL privileges               |\n"
"| FTS / vector recall empty   | `ensure-pg-extensions.sql` applied; `embedding` config enabled |\n"
msgstr ""
"| `memory_type`      | 存储                          | 说明                                                |\n"
"| ------------------ | ----------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `semantic`         | `semantic_memory` hybrid 检索 | 返回完整 `content`                                  |\n"
"| `session`          | `messages` hybrid 检索        | 返回匹配 `snippet`；可选 `session` 限定会话消息范围 |\n"
"| `limbic`           | `limbic_memory` ILIKE         | 感性记忆正文                                        |\n"
"| `autobiographical` | `autobiographical_memory`     | `title` + `content` snippet                         |\n"

